bc_enchanting_guide.desc.enchantment.arrowKnockback=Arrows push the target back further.
bc_enchanting_guide.desc.enchantment.crossbowMultishot=A crossbow shoots three projectiles at once.
bc_enchanting_guide.desc.enchantment.crossbowPiercing=Crossbow arrows pass through several targets.
bc_enchanting_guide.desc.enchantment.crossbowQuickCharge=The crossbow reloads faster.
bc_enchanting_guide.desc.enchantment.curse.binding=Armor with this curse cannot be taken off.
bc_enchanting_guide.desc.enchantment.curse.vanishing=The item is destroyed when you die.
bc_enchanting_guide.desc.enchantment.damage.all=Melee weapons deal extra damage.
bc_enchanting_guide.desc.enchantment.damage.arthropods=Extra damage to spiders, silverfish, and other arthropods.
bc_enchanting_guide.desc.enchantment.damage.undead=Extra damage to undead mobs.
bc_enchanting_guide.desc.enchantment.digging=Tools mine faster.
bc_enchanting_guide.desc.enchantment.durability=The item lasts longer before it breaks.
bc_enchanting_guide.desc.enchantment.fire=The target of a melee hit burns for longer.
bc_enchanting_guide.desc.enchantment.fishingSpeed=The fishing rod catches fish faster.
bc_enchanting_guide.desc.enchantment.frostWalker=Water you walk on turns to ice.
bc_enchanting_guide.desc.enchantment.heavy_weapon.breach=The mace ignores some of the target's armor.
bc_enchanting_guide.desc.enchantment.heavy_weapon.density=The mace deals more damage from a fall.
bc_enchanting_guide.desc.enchantment.heavy_weapon.windBurst=The mace launches you upward on a smash.
bc_enchanting_guide.desc.enchantment.knockback=Melee hits push the target back further.
bc_enchanting_guide.desc.enchantment.lootBonus=Mobs drop more loot.
bc_enchanting_guide.desc.enchantment.lootBonusDigger=Blocks drop more items when mined.
bc_enchanting_guide.desc.enchantment.lootBonusFishing=Fishing yields more treasure.
bc_enchanting_guide.desc.enchantment.mending=Experience repairs the item.
bc_enchanting_guide.desc.enchantment.oxygen=You can stay underwater for longer.
bc_enchanting_guide.desc.enchantment.protect.all=Reduces damage from most sources.
bc_enchanting_guide.desc.enchantment.protect.explosion=Reduces damage and knockback from explosions.
bc_enchanting_guide.desc.enchantment.protect.fall=Reduces fall damage.
bc_enchanting_guide.desc.enchantment.protect.fire=Reduces fire and burning damage.
bc_enchanting_guide.desc.enchantment.protect.projectile=Reduces damage from projectiles.
bc_enchanting_guide.desc.enchantment.soul_speed=You walk faster on soul sand and soul soil.
bc_enchanting_guide.desc.enchantment.swift_sneak=You sneak faster.
bc_enchanting_guide.desc.enchantment.thorns=Attackers take some of the damage they deal.
bc_enchanting_guide.desc.enchantment.tridentChanneling=A thrown trident calls lightning on the target during a storm.
bc_enchanting_guide.desc.enchantment.tridentImpaling=The trident deals extra damage to mobs in water or rain.
bc_enchanting_guide.desc.enchantment.tridentLoyalty=A thrown trident returns to you.
bc_enchanting_guide.desc.enchantment.tridentRiptide=The trident launches you forward when thrown in water or rain.
bc_enchanting_guide.desc.enchantment.untouching=Blocks drop themselves, such as spawners or ores, when mined.
bc_enchanting_guide.desc.enchantment.waterWalker=You move faster through water.
bc_enchanting_guide.desc.enchantment.waterWorker=Mining underwater is no slower.
bc_beacon_info.title=Sinalizador
bc_beacon_info.line.0=Build a pyramid of iron, gold, emerald, diamond, or netherite blocks under the beacon to power it.
bc_beacon_info.line.1=A bigger pyramid unlocks more effects. Pick one primary effect.
bc_beacon_info.line.2=Pay with one accepted ingot: iron, gold, emerald, diamond, or netherite.
bc_beacon_info.line.3=At pyramid level 4 you can also pick Regeneration as a second effect.
bc_cartography_info.title=Mesa de cartografia
bc_cartography_info.line.0=Copy a map: a filled map and an empty map.
bc_cartography_info.line.1=Zoom out a map: a filled map and paper.
bc_cartography_info.line.2=Lock a map so it cannot change: a filled map and a glass pane.
bc_cartography_info.line.3=Check the recipe in game if a slot does not accept an item.
bc_grindstone_info.title=Rebolo
bc_grindstone_info.line.0=Put two damaged items of the same type in to repair them into one.
bc_grindstone_info.line.1=Remove enchantments from an item. You get experience back for each one removed.
bc_horse_info.title=Cavalo, burro e mula
bc_horse_info.line.0=Put a saddle in the saddle slot to ride the animal.
bc_horse_info.line.1=Horses take armor in the armor slot.
bc_horse_info.line.2=Donkeys and mules take a chest to gain extra inventory space.
bc_inventory_info.title=Inventário
bc_inventory_info.line.0=The 2x2 grid crafts items. The result slot shows what you can make.
bc_inventory_info.line.1=The armor slots on the side hold your helmet, chestplate, leggings, and boots.
bc_inventory_info.line.2=The off-hand slot holds a second item, such as a shield or a totem.
bc_loom_info.title=Tear
bc_loom_info.line.0=Put a banner and a dye in the loom to make a new banner design.
bc_loom_info.line.1=A banner pattern in the pattern slot adds a design to the banner.
bc_trade_info.title=Comércio com aldeões
bc_trade_info.line.0=Pick a trade from the list. Each trade shows what you pay and what you get.
bc_trade_info.line.1=A trade runs out after its uses and restocks as the villager's day goes on.
